# LOGIN disabled: AUTHENTICATE PLAIN with a continuation. Hand-written
S: * OK [CAPABILITY IMAP4rev1 LOGINDISABLED AUTH=PLAIN] IMAP4 service ready
C: a1 AUTHENTICATE PLAIN
S: +
C: AHNvbWVvbmVAZXhhbXBsZS5jb20AYXBwLXBhc3M=
S: a1 OK user logged in
C: a2 LOGOUT
S: * BYE logging out
S: a2 OK LOGOUT completed
